{{!
    @template enrol_apply/groupkey_warnings

    Warnings under the instance's group key setting: what a mode would do with the course as it
    stands. Each sentence is a language string with no user data in it.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * warnings array - one object per warning, in the order they are read:
      * danger boolean - whether the method would enrol nobody (otherwise a caution)
      * message string - the sentence

    Example context (json):
    {
        "warnings": [
            {"danger": true, "message": "No group in this course has an enrolment key, so nobody can enrol through this method."},
            {"danger": false, "message": "3 applications are still waiting for a decision. Switching to key only does not decide them; they stay in the queue."}
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="enrol_apply-groupkeywarnings">
    {{#warnings}}
        <div class="alert {{#danger}}alert-danger{{/danger}}{{^danger}}alert-warning{{/danger}} mb-1">{{message}}</div>
    {{/warnings}}
</div>
